clim extrapolation with valid_range covering exactly the on-disk data year (2007).
Only 2007 monthly files exist on disk. The model run requests 02/29/2008 (leap day),
which is outside valid_range. check_data_availability verifies the 2007 files span
a full annual cycle (Jan-Dec) then passes. Year-wrapping maps Feb 29 2008 to Feb 2007
and interpolates between Feb 15 and Mar 15 2007.
